that $v(0)=-8.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-8 & =-(0)^{5}+(0)^{2}+2(0)+C \\\\ -8 & =0+C \\\\ C & =-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity $v$ of the particle at time $t$ is $v(t)=-{t}^{5}+{t}^{2}+2t-8.$\n\nWe evaluate the velocity at time $t=2\\,\\text{s}$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(2) & =-(2)^{5}+(2)^{2}+2(2)-8 \\\\  & =-32+4+4-8 \\\\  & =-32\\,\\text{m/s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since the speed is equal to $|v(t)|,$ we conclude that the speed of the particle is $32\\,\\text{m/s}.$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186368984 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186368985 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186368986 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186368987 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1075 #edb/ref 17592186368988 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1079 #edb/ref 17592186368988 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368983 1080 #uuid "4983e865-febb-5177-8d9d-36e1d8cc0067" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368984 1081 "48\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368984 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368984 1084 #uuid "6db83cf6-d8d3-5730-b178-afa053a59e84" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368985 1081 "24\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368985 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368985 1084 #uuid "e2bf0b00-f760-5558-9dca-a8d89ef237b2" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368986 1081 "36\\,\\text{m/s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186368986 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [175921863689