.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can compute the variance of $X$ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we're given that $\\text{E}[X]=3.$ \n\nWe start by computing $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={1}^{2}\\cdot f(1)+{2}^{2}\\cdot f(2)+{4}^{2}\\cdot f(4) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}+4\\cdot \\frac{2}{7}+16\\cdot \\frac{4}{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{73}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{73}{7}-{3}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[1-7X] & =49\\cdot \\text{Var}[X] \\\\  & =49\\cdot \\frac{10}{7} \\\\  & =70.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369086 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369087 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369088 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369089 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369090 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369086 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369085 1080 #uuid "29bc75fb-29c2-53eb-ab80-1dc006cdc829" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369086 1081 "70" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369086 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369086 1084 #uuid "6074b57c-fee0-5942-92a8-495d2e18161d" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369087 1081 "-9" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369087 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 175