69251 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nNote that we can write the equation of our ellipse in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{2}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{3}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nSo, the curve $C$ is an ellipse centered at $O$ with horizontal and vertical semiaxes of $2$ and $3,$ respectively. Therefore, it can be parametrized as \n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,\\,0\\le t\\le 2\\pi .\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖,$ we get following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)j \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,i+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2}+{(3\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4{sin}^{2}⁡t+9{cos}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)+5{cos}^{2}⁡t} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+5{cos}^{2}⁡t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=\\frac{5xy}{3}$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =\\frac{5}{3}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot 3\\operatorname{sin}⁡t=10\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}18xy\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }10\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot \\sqrt{4+5{cos}^{2}⁡t}\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =10{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\sqrt{4+5{cos}^{2}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this using the substitution $u=4+5{cos}^{2}⁡t,$ $\\text{d}u=-10\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\sqrt{4+5{cos}^{2}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{9}^{9}\\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2}{|}_{9}^{9} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369253 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369254 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369255 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369256 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369257 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369256 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369252 1080 #uuid "8892c1d1-bf09-57f9-b961-2232980b93a4" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369253 1081 "-\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369253 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369253 1084 #uuid "9260b1f5-c069-58e4-9001-0c737c56928a" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369254 1081 "\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369254 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369254 1084 #uuid "738241ab-d44b-55ba-bb9d-96dbd28fc498" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369255 1081 "\\frac{5}{3}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369255 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369255 1084 #uuid "99ce02e9-3534-534d-a83e-a4ddea531f3b" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369256 1081 "0" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369256 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369256 1084 #uuid "eddf0c0b-e553-52a6-a938-453d2129d445" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true