{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi }^{3\\pi /2}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t)\\cdot (2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{\\pi }^{3\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{3}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve this using the substitution $u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,$ $\\text{d}u=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{\\int }_{\\pi }^{3\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{3}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t & =4{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{u}^{3}\\,(-\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =-4{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{u}^{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-{u}^{4}{|}_{-1}^{0} \\\\  & =-[(0)^{4}-(-1)^{4}] \\\\  & =-(-1) \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369280 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369281 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369282 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369283 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369284 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369281 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369279 1080 #uuid "b8f91420-1dd1-57a3-bbc3-7cd1a732535b" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369280 1081 "9" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369280 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369280 1084 #uuid "ce947fb0-2af2-5578-bc88-f97fd8bc5195" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369281 1081 "1" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369281 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369281 1084 #uuid "7faeed0c-8c4d-51f9-816f-430b26355ead" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369282 1081 "5" 13194139533449 175921860455