 1084 #uuid "5ba0ac0c-d2ca-5864-b0a8-1497f9993024" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369405 1068 #edb/ref 17592186369406 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369405 1069 "q-126722" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369405 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369405 1071 "![](images/2a/2a89a14bced6f6700614cfad216070154cae165785458f817ea06d266edfde4e.png)\n\nUse Green's theorem to find the area of the region enclosed by the curve \n$C$ parametrized as $r(t)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\,i-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,j$ \nfor $t\\in [0,\\pi ].$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369405 1072 #uuid "8c42efa1-14e8-5edb-ba70-51dc3c6ff4b6" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369405 1074 "First, let $P(x,y)=0$ and $Q(x,y)=x.$\n\nOur simple, smooth, closed path $C$ is negatively oriented, and  \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=1-0=1.\n$$\n\nSo, according to Green's theorem, we can write the area of the region $D$ enclosed by the curve $C$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(D) & ={∬}_{D}\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & =-{∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nNotice that we have to take the line integral with a minus sign since our path is negatively oriented. \n\nSubstituting $P(x,y)=0$ and $Q(x,y)=x,$ we get\n\n$$\n-{∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y=-{∮}_{C}x\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =4\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\,i-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can evaluate our line integral using the substitution $u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\text{d}u=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{∮}_{C}x\\,dy & =-{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\cdot (-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =8{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-8{\\int }_{1}^{-1}{u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =8{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}{u}^{3}{|}_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}({1}^{3}-(-1)^{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369407 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369408 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369409 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369410 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369411 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369408 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369406 1080 #uuid "a332c9c0-5c80-59f8-b499-e9724c2807a6" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369407 1081 "\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369407 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369407 1084 #uuid "107fbbcc-1cef-591d-838c-89092ff4b58f" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369408 1081 "\\frac{16}{3}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369408 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369408 1084 #uuid "8c11bbb3-2d45-5311-90fd-c92caf9bea8c" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369409 1081 "\\frac{25}{3}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369409 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369409 1084 #uuid "2983dbf6-4125-5413-bca4-9b9acc749a72" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369410 1081 "10" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [1759218