\\\  & =-{∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nNotice that we have to take the line integral with a minus sign since the path is negatively oriented.\n\nSubstituting $P(x,y)=-y$ and $Q(x,y)=0,$ we get\n\n$$\n-{∮}_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y={∮}_{C}y\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe derivative of $r(t)$ is\n\n$$\n{r}^{′}(t)=⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t},\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}⟩.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our line integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}y\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{e}^{\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}\\,dt \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369421 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369422 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369423 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369424 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369425 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369422 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369420 1080 #uuid "ff67740a-3837-5c9c-8e44-2824507f3d72" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369421 1081 "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369421 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369421 1084 #uuid "396b8bd9-301b-51ec-aca0-06cdba5ad003" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369422 1081 "\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{e}^{\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t}" 1319413