139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369554 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369554 1084 #uuid "902aa7af-b4ad-592f-94be-7856bea16033" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369555 1081 "(0,2)\\cup (2,\\infty )" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369555 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369555 1084 #uuid "d2194e4b-948a-552f-a11a-f2fbb310a772" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369556 1081 "(-2,0)\\cup (0,\\infty )" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369556 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369556 1084 #uuid "f347024a-ae30-5737-bd3f-e188ac7033d6" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369557 1081 "[-2,0)\\cup (0,\\infty )" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369557 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369557 1084 #uuid "51d43152-983b-53d0-b3f2-aaf899606779" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369558 1081 "[-2,\\infty )" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369558 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369558 1084 #uuid "599d52d9-d782-513c-9c93-83a75fb51aec" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369559 1068 #edb/ref 17592186369560 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369559 1069 "q-127816" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369559 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369559 1071 "Find $g(1)$ given that $f(t)$ and $g(t)$ are two continuous vector-valued functions for which $f(1)=⟨0,1,-2⟩$ and \n\n$$\n{lim}_{t\\to 1}[2f(t)+g(t)]=⟨-1,4,2⟩\\,.\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369559 1072 #uuid "7be73211-a045-5bd4-a851-fcffa968cf61" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369559 1074 "Using the constant multiple, the addition rule for limits, and the fact that both functions are continuous, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to