ligned}\\text{E}[X] & =(-3)\\cdot f(-3)+(-1)\\cdot f(-1)+2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3)+5\\cdot f(5)+12\\cdot f(12) \\\\  & =(-3)(\\frac{1}{6})+(-1)(\\frac{1}{6})+2(\\frac{1}{6})+3(\\frac{1}{6})+5(\\frac{1}{6})+12(\\frac{1}{6}) \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $\\text{E}[X]=3$ into the variance formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}(x-3)^{2}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the variance as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =(-3-3)^{2}\\cdot f(-3)+(-1-3)^{2}\\cdot f(-1)+(2-3)^{2}\\cdot f(2)+(3-3)^{2}\\cdot f(3) \\\\  & +(5-3)^{2}\\cdot f(5)+(12-3)^{2}\\cdot f(12) \\\\  & =36\\cdot f(-3)+16\\cdot f(-1)+1\\cdot f(2)+0\\cdot f(3)+4\\cdot f(5)+81\\cdot f(12) \\\\  & =36(\\frac{1}{6})+16(\\frac{1}{6})+1(\\frac{1}{6})+0+4(\\frac{1}{6})+81(\\frac{1}{6}) \\\\  & =23\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369624 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369625 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369626 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369627 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369628 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369628 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369623 1080 #uuid "cb292d76-d8b8-5b6e-b29f-137fea6dbc9f" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369624 1081 "12" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369624 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369624 1084 #uuid "5c549bdc-e4f9-5518-8a4c-671b8d1d85f7" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369625 1081 "3" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369625 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186