compute $\\text{E}[X].$ Summing up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =(-2)\\cdot f(-2)+(-1)\\cdot f(-1)+1\\cdot f(1)+2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3) \\\\  & =(-2)(\\frac{1}{5})+(-1)(\\frac{1}{5})+1(\\frac{1}{5})+2(\\frac{1}{5})+3(\\frac{1}{5}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & =(-2)^{2}\\cdot f(-2)+(-1)^{2}\\cdot f(-1)+{1}^{2}\\cdot f(1)+{2}^{2}\\cdot f(2)+{3}^{2}\\cdot f(3) \\\\  & =4(\\frac{1}{5})+1(\\frac{1}{5})+1(\\frac{1}{5})+4(\\frac{1}{5})+9(\\frac{1}{5}) \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the variance is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{5}-{(\\frac{3}{5})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{5}-\\frac{9}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{95}{25}-\\frac{9}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{86}{25}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{SD}[X] & =\\sqrt{\\text{Var}[X]} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{86}{25}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{86}}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369631 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369632 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369633 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369634 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369635 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369635 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369630 1080 #uuid "d894c694-0d37-511a-b335-35626b26b0c8" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369631 1081 "\\frac{\\sqr