sing the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we're given that $\\text{E}[X]=-\\frac{1}{2}.$ \n\nWe start by computing $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & =(-2)^{2}\\cdot f(-2)+(-1)^{2}\\cdot f(-1)+{1}^{2}\\cdot f(1)+{2}^{2}\\cdot f(2) \\\\  & =4(\\frac{1}{2})+1(\\frac{1}{8})+1(\\frac{1}{8})+4(\\frac{1}{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{4}-{(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{4}-\\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}X] & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\text{Var}[X] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369666 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369667 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369668 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369669 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369670 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369669 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369665 1080 #uuid "9fedac39-f9a5-56d2-bb87-12bb34c0afda" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369666 1081 "9" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369666 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369666 1084 #uuid "1202808e-11d0-552c-b1f6-577bc207c5ae" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369667 1081 "3" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369667 108