n\nConsequently, $B={[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nNow, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 5\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{9}[\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369735 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369736 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369737 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369738 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369739 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369739 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369734 1080 #uuid "5b7e2ee6-1f7c-594d-b16e-4f2a770ccac3" 13194139533449 17592186045