6d4e3d8cd5" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369907 1074 "Let's examine each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed, every element $A$ in $F$ satisfies ${a}_{12}={a}_{11}={a}_{22},$ however, for the identity matrix ${I}_{2}$ we have ${i}_{12}=0\\ne {i}_{11}.$\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, as for any $2\\times 2$ matrix $A,$ with real entries, we have\n\n$$\nA+O=A.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, For any matrices $A,B\\in F$ we obtain that \n\n$$\nA+B=B+A\n$$\n\nsince matrix addition is commutative.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369909 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369910 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369911 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369912 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369913 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369909 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369908 1080 #uuid "bd4a831e-22a6-5960-9f9d-60fc0a5e8d45" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369909 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369909 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369909 1084 #uuid "a3add6df-0620-5d5c-94f4-8f79018bfc71" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369910 1081 "I only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369910 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369910 1084 #uuid "7e351bb0-d8b2-56f6-82e6-85ccf6a49426" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369911 1081 "III only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369911 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194