$D$ with mass $M$ and mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The radius of gyration ${R}_{x}$ about the $x$-axis is given by\n${R}_{x}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{x}}{M}},$\nwhere ${I}_{x}$ is the moment of inertia about the $x$-axis.\n\n- The radius of gyration ${R}_{y}$ about the $y$-axis is given by\n${R}_{y}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{y}}{M}},$\nwhere ${I}_{y}$ is the moment of inertia about the $y$-axis.\n\n- The radius of gyration ${R}_{0}$ about the origin is given by\n${R}_{0}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{0}}{M}},$\nwhere ${I}_{0}$ is the moment of inertia about the origin.\n\nIn polar coordinates, the region occupied by the plate is given by\n\n$$\nD={(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,0\\le r\\le 3,\\,\\,\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\le \\theta \\le \\pi }.\n$$\n\nThe moment of inertia about the origin, in polar coordinates, is defined as\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta ){r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ,\n$$\n\nwhere $\\lambda (r,\\theta )$ is the mass density function.\n\nAlso, the mass density in terms of polar coordinates is $\\lambda (r,\\theta )=\\frac{2}{9\\pi }Mr.$\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the $x$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta ){r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9\\pi }M{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{3}{r}^{4}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9\\pi }M({\\int }_{0}^{3}{r}^{4}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }\\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9\\pi }M\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}{r}^{5}{|}_{0}^{3}\\cdot \\theta {|}_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{2M}{9\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{243}{5}\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{27M}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the radius of gyration about the $x$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{R}_{0} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{0}}{M}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{27M}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{M}} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369930 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369931 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369932 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369933 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1075 #edb/ref 17592186369934 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1079 #edb/ref 17592186369931 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369929 1080 #uuid "212b590f-3702-52ac-9776-f17dee07ccd5" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369930 1081 "\\sqrt{\\frac{7}{2}}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369930 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369930 1084 #uuid "574f107e-d053-545f-b5f8-008d405be949" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369931 1081 "3\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{5}}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369931 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369931 1084 #uuid "c7ebd3a2-3397-5499-ae71-fcc15dafeb84" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369932 1081 "\\sqrt{\\frac{23}{5}}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369932 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369932 1084 #uuid "b52eb552-1ba2-5104-86c0-fd010b252de3" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369933 1081 "2\\sqrt{\\frac{3}{7}}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369933 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369933 1084 #uuid "22d4881c-6c90-52bb-a406-647807eeda5a" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369934 1081 "\\sqrt{\\frac{31}{6}}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369934 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186369934 1084 #uuid "f95f82fa-ca14-5bfa-8ebd-58ca8e898b1e" 13194139533449 1759