ed}] & =[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-{c}_{1}-3{c}_{2} \\\\ {c}_{1}+2{c}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have a system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-{c}_{1}-3{c}_{2}=5 \\\\ {c}_{1}+2{c}_{2}=9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding the equations, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{c}_{2}=14\\,⟹\\,{c}_{2}=-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${c}_{2}=-14$ into the second equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{1}-2(-14)=9\\,⟹\\,{c}_{1}=37.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the solution to the initial value problem:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =37[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t}-14[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370073 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370074 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370075 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370076 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370077 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370073 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370072 1080 #uuid "3ea9e031-e55c-53ff-bb1f-586d3945e9f9" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370073 1081 "x(t)=37[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t}-14[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370073 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370073 1084 #uuid "2b9bda6e-7e9f-5f46-a9ff-034b8fce5b51" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370074 1081 "x(t)=-6[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-t}-9[\\begin{aligned}-3 \