{aligned}7y-3xy & =0 \\\\ y(7-3x) & =0 \\\\ \\frac{2}{5}(7-3x) & =0 \\\\ 7-3x & =0 \\\\ x & =\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, another equilibrium is $(\\frac{7}{3},\\frac{2}{5}).$\n\nTherefore, the nonzero equilibrium of the model is\n$(\\frac{7}{3},\\frac{2}{5}).$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370203 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370204 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370203 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370203 1077 "field-1" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370203 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370204 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370203 1080 #uuid "d51c4e9d-4fc3-5b94-9fbb-2f1729282196" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370204 1081 "\\frac{7}{3}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370204 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370204 1084 #uuid "401db806-372a-5fd6-8992-621c15114775" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370205 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370206 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370205 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370205 1077 "field-2" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370205 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370206 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370205 1080 #uuid "afe78aeb-3059-5e8a-9a99-9dcbe521ca11" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370206 1081 "\\frac{2}{5}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370206 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370206 1084 #uuid "8e1d1667-541b-5035-a21b-fbdba15ef778" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370207 1068 #edb/ref 17592186370208 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370207 1068 #edb/ref 17592186370214 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370207 1068 #edb/ref 17592186370219 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370207 1068 #edb/ref 17592186370225 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370207 1068 #edb/ref 1