=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, another equilibrium is $(1,1).$\n\nTherefore, the equilibria of the model are\n\n$$\n(0,0),\\,(2,0),\\,(1,1).\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370402 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370403 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370402 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370402 1077 "field-3" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370402 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370403 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370402 1080 #uuid "926c62d3-33b1-5a68-9893-0017786e7108" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370403 1081 "1" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370403 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370403 1084 #uuid "d95c6bb5-0bea-53d7-8912-03fb824348e1" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370404 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370405 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370404 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370404 1077 "field-1" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370404 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370405 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370404 1080 #uuid "919a3769-36fa-5a1a-8af2-ab2341d81379" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370405 1081 "2" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370405 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370405 1084 #uuid "f999bb63-f180-5d3e-bfde-e9b5319a01a4" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370406 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370407 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370406 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370406 1077 "field-2" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370406 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370407 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370406 1080 #uuid "038665d6-3284-5218-82a4-c5a18c2023dc" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370407 1081 "1" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370407 1083 #edb/ref 175