lly, since the speed is equal to $|v(t)|$, we conclude that the speed of the particle is $10\\,\\text{ft}/\\text{s}.$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370968 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370969 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370970 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370971 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370972 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370969 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370967 1080 #uuid "7758e6cc-dfcb-5349-9f30-496d8125479b" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370968 1081 "12\\,\\text{ft}/\\text{s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370968 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370968 1084 #uuid "a5dcba78-4089-500e-8ab2-c2cc5d37e3fa" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370969 1081 "10\\,\\text{ft}/\\text{s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370969 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370969 1084 #uuid "7dfdff8b-dbf6-53f7-8cdd-81c35f62c307" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370970 1081 "30\\,\\text{ft}/\\text{s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370970 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370970 1084 #uuid "195d5561-ae49-54f4-86aa-bfa301c6aadd" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370971 1081 "8\\,\\text{ft}/\\text{s}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370971 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370971 1084 #uuid "7a1a9f57-eb6b-5d28-8a5e-b013a826e713" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370972 1081 "2\\,\\text{ft}