\n\\begin{aligned}2\\lambda (\\lambda -1)+\\lambda -3 & =0 \\\\ 2{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -3 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +1)(2\\lambda -3) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the roots are $\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =\\frac{3}{2}.$\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\ny(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-1}+{c}_{2}{t}^{3/2}.\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370994 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370995 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370996 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370997 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370998 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1079 #edb/ref 17592186370995 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370993 1080 #uuid "5423d9f6-8712-5e07-a5df-36f3b53200cd" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370994 1081 "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-3/2}+{c}_{2}t" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370994 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370994 1084 #uuid "ecd58657-d532-5db6-a261-72261561f791" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370995 1081 "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-1}+{c}_{2}{t}^{3/2}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370995 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370995 1084 #uuid "34af5a00-89e1-540b-9527-3a85a6289b5f" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370996 1081 "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{2}+{c}_{2}{t}^{-1/2}" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370996 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370996 1084 #uuid "3c48972c-0db3-5b91-aa59-d125d1123077" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186370997 1081 "y(t)={c}_{1}{t}^{-1}+{c}_{2}{t}^{-2}" 13194139533449 175921