t}^{2}}$ is not defined for these values. Hence,  the function $g(t)$ is not differentiable on $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- Finally, we differentiate $h(t)$ to find ${h}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2)\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\,k \\\\  & =i-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince each component of ${h}^{′}(t)$ is defined for all $(-\\infty ,\\infty )$, we have that   $h(t)$ is also differentiable on this interval.\n\nTherefore, the answer is \"$h(t)$ only.\"" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371015 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371016 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371017 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371018 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371019 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371018 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371014 1080 #uuid "6b29eb99-a62c-5999-8c7c-50d4a21550fc" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371015 1081 "$f(t)$ and $g(t)$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371015 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371015 1084 #uuid "644ab553-3510-5a16-a3b2-3f4c62a9c7f8" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371016 1081 "$f(t)$ and $h(t)$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371016 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371016 1084 #uuid "69c7679f-fa1d-5826-b2a5-56ebe22778b7" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371017 1081 "$h(t)$ and $g(t)$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371017 1083