075 #edb/ref 17592186371023 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371024 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371025 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371026 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371026 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371021 1080 #uuid "c06fe163-6d62-5008-84ea-a2bdcef61a04" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371022 1081 "⟨2,4,6⟩" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371022 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371022 1084 #uuid "bc3cf782-2cc5-587d-8f57-81569fb8fb47" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371023 1081 "⟨1,-1,6⟩" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371023 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371023 1084 #uuid "e683a6d8-1dac-5d08-a1f9-486b67b1693c" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371024 1081 "⟨0,-2,2⟩" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371024 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371024 1084 #uuid "c85a1d8d-c272-51ac-80f2-e7516005c6ed" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371025 1081 "⟨2,-1,4⟩" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371025 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371025 1084 #uuid "cb86536d-3b6e-51b5-a068-784b0ef0c474" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371026 1081 "⟨1,-2,4⟩" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371026 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371026 1084 #uuid "7e849b5c-fcf0-513c-949c-a7565babfe7f" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371027 1068 #edb/ref 17592186371028 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371027 1069 "q-70562" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371027 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371027 1071 "Which of the following vector-valued functions are differentiable at $t=0?$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨|t-1|,\\,7t+6,\\,3⟩ \\\\ g(t) & =⟨1,\\,{t}^{2},\\,t⟩ \\\\ h(t) & =⟨{t}^{3}+1,\\,\\sqrt[3]{t},\\,2t+3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371027 1072 #uuid "0bbcfb4c-f760-5fd6-8a2e-18e321594a3b" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371027 1074 "All of these vector-valued functions are defined at $t=0.$ \n\nA vector-valued function is differentiable at a point if and only if each of its components is differentiable at that point. \n\nLet's consider the functions one-by-one. \n\n- We differentiate $f(t)$ to find ${f}^{′}(0).$\nNote, that the derivative of $|t-1|$ at  $t=0$ coincides with the derivative of $(1-t),$ so, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(0) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(7t+6),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,7,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince each component of ${f}^{′}(t)$ is  defined  at $t=0$, we conclude that $f(t)$ is differentiable at this point.\n\n- Next, we differentiate $g(t)$  to find ${g}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,2t,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince each component of ${g}^{′}(t)$ is defined   at $t=0$, we conclude that $g(t)$ is differentiable at this point.\n\n- Finally, we differentiate $h(t)$ to find ${h}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{3}+1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\sqrt[3]{t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t+3)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3{t}^{2},\\,\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}},\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the second component of this vector, $\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}$, is undefined at $t=0$,  we conclude that the function $h(t)$ is not differentiable at $t=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$f(t)$ and $g(t)$ only.\"" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371029 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371030 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371031 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371032 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371033 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371030 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371028 1080 #uuid "384fb48a-7c22-5523-9243-4df4194d5e1f" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371029 1081 "All of them are differentiable  at $t=0$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371029 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371029 1084 #uuid "a9bddaef-630f-54f6-b781-8043fe6d7987" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371030 1081 "$f(t)$ and $g(t)$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371030 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371030 1084 #uuid "d99d7eed-bcc0-5290-8bef-c78d6e010b51" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371031 1081 "$f(t)$ and $h(t)$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371031 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371031 1084 #uuid "17d372ce-2ed4-562d-a318-df0b3b0a9dc3" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371032 1081 "None of them are differentiable  at $t=0$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371032 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371032 1084 #uuid "4c0e68d4-3716-504b-80d6-7d91f33a1724" 13194139533449 1759218