hip with respect to $t$ using implicit differentiation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(A) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{\\pi {D}^{2}}{4}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}A}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}D}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}D}(\\frac{\\pi {D}^{2}}{4}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}A}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}D}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\pi D}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $\\frac{\\text{d}A}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{\\text{d}D}{\\text{d}t},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{\\text{d}D}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}D}{\\text{d}t}\\cdot \\frac{\\pi D}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & =\\frac{\\pi D}{2} \\\\ D & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, since $D=2r,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2r & =\\frac{1}{\\pi } \\\\ r & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371057 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371058 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371059 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371060 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371061 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371057 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371056 1080 #uuid "ae9f1353-e125-579a-89f7-0bea4ef12311" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371057 1081 "\\frac{1}{2\\pi }" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371057 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371057 1084 #uuid "f68945ce-1ccd-5a70-980c-7997d4b6a58b" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371058 1081 "\\frac{1}{4\\pi }" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371058 1083 #edb/ref 175