 want to find ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R$ such that \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{1}}+{x}_{2}{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{2}}+{x}_{3}{{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{3}}={{[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{4}}.\n$$\n\nThis equation is equivalent to the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3}=-4 \\\\ -9{x}_{1}-8{x}_{3}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we reduce the augmented matrix of the system to reduced row echelon form (RREF):\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2 & -4 \\\\ -9 & 0 & -8 & -1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -9 & 0 & -8 & -1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+9{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 17\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-1){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 17\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the reduced matrix above, we see that the pivot columns are the $1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd columns. So,  $B$ is indeed a basis of $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3},{a}_{4}}.$\nAlso, the matrix tells us that ${x}_{1}=-15,$ ${x}_{2}=0,$ and ${x}_{3}=17,$ meaning that\n\n$$\n(-15)\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{1}}+0\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{2}}+17\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{3}}={{[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{a}_{4}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=(-15)+0+17=2.$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371077 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371078 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371077 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371079 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371077 1075 #e