045585 true] [17592186371111 1072 #uuid "27ca83bf-1817-5b87-965e-2e220104951a" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371111 1074 "Given a system of first-order linear ODEs in the form\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $A$ has two distinct eigenvalues ${\\lambda }_{1},{\\lambda }_{2}$ with corresponding eigenvectors ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2},$ the formula for the general solution is\n\n$$\nx(t)={c}_{1}{v}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}+{c}_{2}{v}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to our matrix differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={c}_{1}{v}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}+{c}_{2}{v}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-3t}+{c}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to find the values of ${c}_{1}$ and ${c}_{2}$, we substitute $t=0$ into the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(0) & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{0}+{c}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{0} & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-5{c}_{1} \\\\ {c}_{1}+{c}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have a system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-5{c}_{1}=10 \\\\ {c}_{1}+{c}_{2}=-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n-5{c}_{1}=10\\,⟹\\,{c}_{1}=-2.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n-2+{c}_{2}=-7\\,⟹\\,{c}_{2}=-5.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the solution for the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =-2\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-3t}+(-5)\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-3t}+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate $x(3)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(3) & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-3\\cdot 3}+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2\\cdot 3} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-9}+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]{e}^{6} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10{e}^{-9} \\\\ -2{e}^{-9}-5{e}^{6}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371113 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371114 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371115 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371116 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371117 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371115 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371112 1080 #uuid "a24153c5-9dd8-5631-a7a5-5e9a93fac81c" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371113 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-5{e}^{-9} \\\\ {e}^{-9}+5{e}^{6}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371113 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371113 1084 #uuid "a5572763-9798-5541-88d1-7eff664f6124" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371114 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-10{e}^{-9} \\\\ 5{e}^{-9}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371114 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371114 1084 #uuid "3dccc843-2599-507e-a533-65cb44274b4e" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371115 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}10{e}^{-9} \\\\ -2{e}^{-9}-5{e}^{6}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371115 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371115 1084 #uuid "09a56494-a89b-5756-a703-dc8bcc76ebfc" 131941