d{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]}$\n- $V={[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]}$\n- $W={[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371173 1072 #uuid "5d55bdef-1f91-5e0a-9c79-2e4df04e0183" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371173 1074 "Let's denote the vectors of the given sets as \n${{u}_{1},{u}_{2}},$\n${{v}_{1},{v}_{2}},$ and \n${{w}_{1},{w}_{2}}$, respectively. \n\nThe sets $U,V,$ and $W$ are orthonormal if the following conditions on each set hold:\n\n- ${u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2}=0\\,\\text{and}\\,{\\begin{aligned}{u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{1}=1 \\\\ {u}_{2}\\cdot {u}_{2}=1.\\end{aligned}$\n\n- ${v}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{2}=0\\,\\text{and}\\,{\\begin{aligned}{v}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{1}=1 \\\\ {v}_{2}\\cdot {v}_{2}=1.\\end{aligned}$\n\n- ${w}_{1}\\cdot {w}_{2}=0\\,\\text{and}\\,{\\begin{aligned}{w}_{1}\\cdot {w}_{1}=1 \\\\ {w}_{2}\\cdot {w}_{2}=1.\\end{aligned}$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our sets in turn.\n\n- For the set $U,$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]=\\frac{3}{10}-\\frac{3}{10}=0 & ✓ \\\\ {u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{1} & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]=\\frac{9}{10}+\\frac{1}{10}=1 & ✓ \\\\ {u}_{2}\\cdot {u}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ -\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]=\\frac{1}{10}+\\frac{9}{10}=1 & ✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the set $U$ is orthonormal.\n\n- For the set $V,$ notice that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{v}_{1}\\cdot {v}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]=-1-1=-2\\ne 0 & \\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $V$ is not an orthonormal set.\n\n- For the set $W,$ notice that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{w}_{1}\\cdot {w}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}=-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{5}}\\ne 0 & \\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $W$ is not an orthonormal set.\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the correct answer is \"$U$ only\"." 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371175 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371176 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371177 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371178 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371179 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371176 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371174 1080 #uuid "6b4fd289-0e6e-5266-b604-4788ccf8aeb2" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371175 1081 "$U$ and $W$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371175 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371175 1084 #uuid "3cbab6d5-2c47-5809-8c50-59b4a396ed56" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371176 1081 "$U$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371176 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371176 1084 #uuid "27c25169-77c5-518c-afea-b58233d594f3" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371177 1081 "$V$ only" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371