d-a2d8-5cf8-869f-04f6df4aadad" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371221 1074 "We can compute the variance of a discrete random variable $X$ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute $\\text{E}[X].$ Summing up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =0\\cdot f(0)+1\\cdot f(1)+2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3)+4\\cdot f(4) \\\\  & =0(\\frac{256}{625})+1(\\frac{256}{625})+2(\\frac{96}{625})+3(\\frac{16}{625})+4(\\frac{1}{625}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={0}^{2}\\cdot f(1)+{1}^{2}\\cdot f(2)+{2}^{2}\\cdot f(3)+{3}^{2}\\cdot f(4)+{4}^{2}\\cdot f(5) \\\\  & =0(\\frac{256}{625})+1(\\frac{256}{625})+4(\\frac{96}{625})+9(\\frac{16}{625})+16(\\frac{1}{625}) \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{25}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{25}-{(\\frac{4}{5})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{25}-\\frac{16}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{25}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371223 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371224 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371225 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371226 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371227 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371225 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371222 1080 #uuid "f80016c8-d0ec-540f-b9e0-f6708f53835d" 131941395