rac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}{x}_{2}=0,\n$$\n\nwe get a nonzero solution $[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Normalizing this vector, we finally obtain the  second column of $U:$\n\n$$\n{u}_{2}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371305 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371306 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371307 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371308 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1075 #edb/ref 17592186371309 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1077 "selection" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1079 #edb/ref 17592186371305 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371304 1080 #uuid "50e0371b-e61c-5694-8b26-5a3118897b89" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371305 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371305 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371305 1084 #uuid "aa9fc468-4dcf-5ab9-b9e7-27fd958f8cff" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371306 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} \\\\ \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371306 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371306 1084 #uuid "b79d8023-bd9b-5efa-9332-63ce925d35eb" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371307 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371307 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533449 17592186045585 true] [17592186371307 1084 #uuid 